sequenceDiagram
    participant Stream as Redis Stream
    participant W1 as Worker 1
    participant W2 as Worker 2
    participant Handler as Event Handler
    participant DLQ as Dead Letter Queue

    loop Read-Process-Ack Loop
        W1->>Stream: XREADGROUP group order-processor consumer-1 COUNT 10 BLOCK 2000
        Stream-->>W1: [event-A, event-B]

        W1->>Handler: handler(event-A)
        Handler-->>W1: success
        W1->>Stream: XACK event-A

        W1->>Handler: handler(event-B)
        Handler-->>W1: raises exception

        W1->>Stream: XCLAIM event-B IDLE (60s - backoff)
        Note over W1: event-B stays PENDING<br/>reclaimable once the backoff has passed
    end

    Note over W1,W2: Pending Message Reclaimer (runs every 1s)

    W2->>Stream: XPENDING + XCLAIM idle >= 60s
    Stream-->>W2: event-B (reclaimed)
    W2->>Handler: handler(event-B) — retry #1
    Handler-->>W2: raises exception again

    Note over W2: After max_retries (default 5)

    W2->>DLQ: MULTI: XADD eventbus:dlq:order-processor (event-B + error)
    W2->>Stream: XACK event-B, EXEC
